    kernel(n, r, x, y, nb);
    double t1 = now_sec();

    double sum = 0.0;
    for (long i = 0; i < n; i++) sum += nb[i];
    report("cutoff", t1 - t0, sum);
    free(xy); free(x); free(y); free(nb);
    return 0;
}
```

The private arrays take about 1.6 MB per thread, roughly 16 MB at 10 threads. Clearing and summing them costs very little next to the roughly 10⁹ distance tests.
